{"id":"5121b107e6141953","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete.md","title":"Degeneracy of Ordinary GLB Frames","display":"thm-glb-kripke-incomplete — Degeneracy of Ordinary GLB Frames","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete","aliases":["89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete"],"display":"thm-glb-kripke-incomplete — Degeneracy of Ordinary GLB Frames","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]]","[[89-df-omega-consistency]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-glb-kripke-incomplete — Degeneracy of Ordinary GLB Frames"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90426ebd1dd924ef\" href=\"?note=90426ebd1dd924ef\" title=\"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness\">89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f367207d33b1e75f\" href=\"?note=f367207d33b1e75f\" title=\"89-df-omega-consistency\">89-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc6b2cfbdcc658df\" href=\"?note=cc6b2cfbdcc658df\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics\">89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>双框架 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R_0,R_1)\">\\((W,R_0,R_1)\\)</span> 非空；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_i\">\\(\\Box_i\\)</span> 采用对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 后继全称量化的普通 Kripke 语义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>该框架在所有命题赋值下验证全部 GLB 公理。标准 PA 可靠。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\)</span> 为双模态定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 由标准可靠性推出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}incomplete}\\vdash\nR_1=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n(W,R_0,R_1)\\models\\Box_1\\bot,\\qquad\n\\Box_1\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GLB}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}incomplete}\\vdash\nR_1=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n(W,R_0,R_1)\\models\\Box_1\\bot,\\qquad\n\\Box_1\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GLB}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 192–194；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n第一交互模式在所有赋值下有效迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_1\\subseteq R_0\">\\(R_1\\subseteq R_0\\)</span>。Löb 的框架条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0\">\\(R_0\\)</span> 非自反。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wR_1v\">\\(wR_1v\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为假；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wR_0v\">\\(wR_0v\\)</span>，世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box_0A\">\\(\\neg\\Box_0A\\)</span>。第二交互模式迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box_0A\">\\(\\neg\\Box_0A\\)</span>，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"vR_0v\">\\(vR_0v\\)</span>，矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_1\">\\(R_1\\)</span> 为空。\n空关系验证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_1\\bot\">\\(\\Box_1\\bot\\)</span>；但其算术解释说 PA 的一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则证明矛盾，标准可靠性使该句为假，GLB 可靠性排除其可证。因此 GLB 不能由普通双框架类完全刻画。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"90426ebd1dd924ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f367207d33b1e75f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"cc6b2cfbdcc658df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-kripke-semantics]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(W,R_0,R_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_i","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}incomplete}\\vdash\nR_1=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n(W,R_0,R_1)\\models\\Box_1\\bot,\\qquad\n\\Box_1\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GLB}.","display":true},{"tex":"R_1\\subseteq R_0","display":false},{"tex":"R_0","display":false},{"tex":"wR_1v","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"wR_0v","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box_0A","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box_0A","display":false},{"tex":"vR_0v","display":false},{"tex":"R_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_1\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1678,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]] → [[89-df-omega-provability]] → [[89-df-bimodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glb-logic]] → [[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]] → [[89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete]] → [[89-df-glsb-logic]] → [[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["5a9efa2261b8f73c","90426ebd1dd924ef","f367207d33b1e75f","c6ab46cd662b1409","cc6b2cfbdcc658df"]}